<p class="lt-chem-36401">1) Nucleophilic attack by an alcohol</p>

<p class="mt-align-center lt-chem-36401"><img src="data:image/png;base64," style="width: 424px; height: 171px;" /></p>

<p class="lt-chem-36401">2) Leaving group removal</p>

